cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "snRNA-seq Preprocessing & QC Pipeline"
abstract: "A reproducible preprocessing and quality-control pipeline for 10x Genomics single-nucleus RNA-seq data, covering ambient RNA removal with CellBender, doublet detection with DoubletFinder, and cell-level filtering, with hand-off to Scanpy or Seurat."
